                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The purpose of the dataset was to measure the sense of community in blended and online learning communities. A survey was used to measure the sense of community amongst students before and after an experiment focused on improving social commitment. Furthermore, group interviews were organised to elaborate on the questions of the survey."
